{
  "id": "773",
  "title": "When To Go To Sichuan",
  "level": "newbie",
  "date": "2019-07-25",
  "synopsis": "When should you go to Sichuan? When is the weather best?",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/1109/c572e5f65396902ab4548e2b17d388d0a0d0af80.mp3?1563819056",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "哪个月去四川最好？\n\n本：小雨，你去过四川吗？\n小雨：去过，去年8月去的。\n本：四川怎么样？\n小雨：很漂亮。但是8月太热了。\n本：我今年想去四川。哪个月去最好？\n小雨：4月和10月。那时候的四川最漂亮，而且不热。",
    "traditional": "哪個月去四川最好？\n\n本：小雨，你去過四川嗎？\n小雨：去過，去年8月去的。\n本：四川怎麼樣？\n小雨：很漂亮。但是8月太熱了。\n本：我今年想去四川。哪個月去最好？\n小雨：4月和10月。那時候的四川最漂亮，而且不熱。"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Which month is the best to go to Sichuan?"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "本：小雨，你去过四川吗？",
      "traditional": "本：小雨，你去過四川嗎？",
      "pinyin": "běn xiǎo yǔ nǐ qù guò sì chuān ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: Little Yu, have you been to Sichuan?"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "小雨：去过，去年8月去的。",
      "traditional": "小雨：去過，去年8月去的。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo yǔ qù guò qù nián 1 yuè qù de",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Yu: Yes, I went last year in August."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "本：四川怎么样？",
      "traditional": "本：四川怎麼樣？",
      "pinyin": "běn sì chuān zěn me yàng",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: How was Sichuan?"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "小雨：很漂亮。但是8月太热了。",
      "traditional": "小雨：很漂亮。但是8月太熱了。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo yǔ hěn piào liang dàn shì 1 yuè tài rè le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Yu: Very beautiful. But it was too hot in August."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "本：我今年想去四川。哪个月去最好？",
      "traditional": "本：我今年想去四川。哪個月去最好？",
      "pinyin": "běn wǒ jīn nián xiǎng qù sì chuān nǎ ge yuè qù zuì hǎo",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: I want to go to Sichuan this year. Which month is best to go?"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "小雨：4月和10月。那时候的四川最漂亮，而且不热。",
      "traditional": "小雨：4月和10月。那時候的四川最漂亮，而且不熱。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo yǔ 1 yuè hé 1 yuè nà shí hou de sì chuān zuì piào liang ér qiě bù rè",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Yu: April and October. Sichuan is the most beautiful at that time, and also not hot."
    }
  ],
